  "description": "This fantastic 2 bedroom, 1 bathroom, unfurnished unit is nestled less than 200m from the Swan River foreshore!<br/><br/>Please watch our walk through video tour to gain a better understanding of this lovely home.<br/><br/>Here are just some of the things you will love about this property:<br/><br/> - Located on the 4th floor (top floor) with amazing views of the Swan River from the balcony<br/> - 2 spacious bedrooms; one bedroom featuring a built in robe<br/> - Freshly painted throughout<br/> - NBN ready<br/> - Renovated kitchen with electric cooktop and oven<br/> - Open plan kitchen/dining/lounge area with reverse cycle air conditioning<br/> - Renovated bathroom with combined laundry<br/> - Separate toilet<br/> - One allocated, covered car bay in a secure, well maintained complex<br/> - Bicycle storage area<br/><br/>The location of this property is definitely a crowd pleaser! The Swan River foreshore is less than 200m away where you can enjoy a scenic walk or cycle!<br/><br/>The location also offers quick commuting to and from the CBD however there's plenty in South Perth to cover your needs including a great selection of eateries ranging from fine dining to cafes, supermarkets & shops and plenty more!<br/><br/>This lovely home has many features and benefits that we would love to show you, please book in a time to come and see for yourself. <br/><br/>This property is proudly marketed by Access Property Management",
